          <div class="question"><b>Q6. How much does deploy cost for HTML CSS JS?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="a"> Free - No card needed</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="b"> Rs. 10,000 / month</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="c"> Rs. 5,000 / month</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="d"> $100 / month</label></div>
